To support student learning, safety, and well-being, Northshore School District has adopted a new policy that limits student use of personal smart devices during the school day. The policy is was implemented last fall based on guidance from the state and supported by Northshore’s
Mobile Devices in Schools Task Force
that met during the 2024-24 school year.
