The Capital Projects Bond would allow us to fund:
Districtwide safety and accessibility upgrades and improvements to playfields and athletic spaces
Building improvements (including HVAC, kitchens, roofing, and other improvement projects)
Seismic upgrades
Installation of inclusive playgrounds
Four major projects at schools with the most needs: Inglemoor High School (Phase 2) replacement, Leota Middle School (Phase 2) replacement, Shelton View Elementary replacement, and Kokanee Elementary expansion
Reduce reliance on portable classrooms
