Northshore Learning Options serves cold lunches on all days when students have classes or testing days. Lunches are prepared off-site and delivered to our campus each day for students who are interested in purchasing a school lunch. Much like in the comprehensive school program, students will have the ability to purchase a lunch using their student ID (we also have the ability to collect cash should this be the preferred option for families) Interested students can snag their lunch in the gym as their lunch period begins.
