monthly menu and pricing options
. When folks follow the link, they should select “Bear Creek” as the school. Following that, they should select the grade level listed under “Northshore Learning Options”. That page will detail the menu items each day as well as pricing information for lunch. Due to the nature of having our lunches delivered, we are able to offer lunch options most of the week instead of just on the day they are listed on the menu.
Students are also able to purchase milk by itself.
Important to know, if your student does not know their student ID, we are very happy to help! We can always look that information up in real time. Please don’t hesitate to reach out if you have questions about lunch on campus.
